DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
11203::$$$message_0089_0000_0000$$$::What should I do for lunch?[lr]::
11204::$$$message_0089_0000_0001$$$::Should I go to the cafeteria for the first time in a while and have that B meal that only tasted like meat...? Nah, I'm not that hungry.[lr]::
11205::$$$message_0089_0000_0002$$$::I'll think about it once I'm with someone first.[lr]::
11206::$$$message_0089_0000_0003$$$::Oh, there's Tohsaka[line len=2]::
11207::$$$message_0089_0001_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
11208::$$$message_0089_0001_0001$$$::...It's supposed to be lunch, right?[lr]::
11209::$$$message_0089_0001_0002$$$::She's wobbly as if I ran into her first thing in the morning.[lr]::
11210::$$$message_0089_0001_0003$$$::How disgraceful as the number one model student of the school... No, she's acting strange.::
11211::$$$message_0089_0002_0000$$$::"What happened, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
11212::$$$message_0089_0002_0001$$$::"Oh, Emiya."[lr]::
11213::$$$message_0089_0002_0002$$$::She returns to her usual self for a moment.[lr]::
11214::$$$message_0089_0002_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服01a(中) textoff=0]Her faking modesty so much that it's unnatural is as per usual, but she's still acting suspiciously.::
11215::$$$message_0089_0003_0000$$$::"You were walking around with quite an expression on, but is everything all right?"[lr]::
11216::$$$message_0089_0003_0001$$$::"...Quite an expression? You're merciless even to girls huh, Shirou? Are you asking if something's wrong with me?"[lr]::
11217::$$$message_0089_0003_0002$$$::No, it's because you were clearly acting like you weren't feeling well.[lr]::
11218::$$$message_0089_0003_0003$$$::But I can't get myself to say that.[lr]::
11219::$$$message_0089_0003_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服06e(中) textoff=0]Looking at her like this, she's the usual, impeccable Rin Tohsaka. Was I seeing things?::
11220::$$$message_0089_0004_0000$$$::"Well, I'm glad you're fine... What are you doing for lunch?"[lr]::
11221::$$$message_0089_0004_0001$$$::"I was just thinking about eating on the rooftop.[lr]::
11222::$$$message_0089_0004_0002$$$::Do you have any plans?"[lr]::
11223::$$$message_0089_0004_0003$$$::"No. Let's eat together then. I'll go buy my lunch, so I'll meet you later."[lr]::
11224::$$$message_0089_0004_0004$$$::I make a promise first before parting.::
11225::$$$message_0089_0005_0000$$$::I buy a random sandwich and bread at the cafeteria and drinks for the two of us... She'll probably start complaining if I don't make her black tea hot.::
11226::$$$message_0089_0006_0000$$$::I hurry to not make her wait.[lr]::
11227::$$$message_0089_0006_0001$$$::When I go up the stairs, Tohsaka is still wobbly. Just as I was thinking she must've not gotten enough sleep from staying up all night doing something...[lr]::
11228::$$$message_0089_0006_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
11229::$$$message_0089_0006_0003$$$::...![lr]::
11230::$$$message_0089_0006_0004$$$::Tohsaka collapses in front of my eyes.[lr]::
11231::$$$message_0089_0006_0005$$$::As if she ran out of battery.::
11232::$$$message_0089_0007_0000$$$::I frantically run over to her.[lr]::
11233::$$$message_0089_0007_0001$$$::She collapsed on the landing of the stairs.::
11234::$$$message_0089_0008_0000$$$::"Are you okay, Tohsaka!?"[lr]::
11235::$$$message_0089_0008_0001$$$::This Tohsaka isn't normal.[lr]::
11236::$$$message_0089_0008_0002$$$::Khh... I should've told her to rest when she was being wobbly earlier.[lr]::
11237::$$$message_0089_0008_0003$$$::Tohsaka's body that I'm holding up is rather fever-like.::
11238::$$$message_0089_0009_0000$$$::"Ah... Mm..."[lr]::
11239::$$$message_0089_0009_0001$$$::I can't even tell if she's conscious or not.[lr]::
11240::$$$message_0089_0009_0002$$$::I can't leave her lying like this. I should hurry and carry her to the nurse's office.::
11241::$$$message_0089_0010_0000$$$::"Sorry, Tohsaka..."[lr]::
11242::$$$message_0089_0010_0001$$$::[clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=300]I apologize and carry Tohsaka's body.[lr]::
11243::$$$message_0089_0010_0002$$$::The strength is gone from Tohsaka's body in my arms, but she's still light.[lr]::
11244::$$$message_0089_0010_0003$$$::She must've woken up, as I hear her whisper.::
11245::$$$message_0089_0011_0000$$$::"N... Idiot, you don't have...to..."[lr]::
11246::$$$message_0089_0011_0001$$$::"You shouldn't be acting strong right now. Don't you feel sick?"[lr]::
11247::$$$message_0089_0011_0002$$$::"Ah... Y...yeah, a bit..."[lr]::
11248::$$$message_0089_0011_0003$$$::Tohsaka is limp in my arms.[lr]::
11249::$$$message_0089_0011_0004$$$::I'm self-conscious of my surroundings, but I need to take Tohsaka to the nurse's office as soon as possible.::
11250::$$$message_0089_0012_0000$$$::"...Ah... Shirou..."::
11251::$$$message_0089_0013_0000$$$::I take Tohsaka to the nurse's office and wait in the hallway.[lr]::
11252::$$$message_0089_0013_0001$$$::I'm still holding both our lunches.[lr]::
11253::$$$message_0089_0013_0002$$$::I don't feel like calmly eating my lunch until I know Tohsaka's condition.[lr]::
11254::$$$message_0089_0013_0003$$$::...The black tea is cold now.::
11255::$$$message_0089_0014_0000$$$::"...[chgfg storage=凛制服10a(中) time=300 textoff=0][resumevoice]Oh."[lr]::
11256::$$$message_0089_0014_0001$$$::"Yo... Tohsaka. Are you okay?"[lr]::
11257::$$$message_0089_0014_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服02b(中) textoff=0]Her expression is clouded, but her footing is steady, so it seems like there is no need to worry about her collapsing.::
11258::$$$message_0089_0015_0000$$$::"Shirou... You haven't had lunch yet?"[lr]::
11259::$$$message_0089_0015_0001$$$::"I was waiting for you. I brought yours."[lr]::
11260::$$$message_0089_0015_0002$$$::"...I see. Why don't we go then."[lr]::
11261::$$$message_0089_0015_0003$$$::[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から pos=all time=300]I start walking, as invited.::
11262::$$$message_0089_0016_0000$$$::Tohsaka was in the nurse's office for only ten minutes or so.[lr]::
11263::$$$message_0089_0016_0001$$$::Isn't she still pushing herself? Is she okay walking like this?[lr]::
11264::$$$message_0089_0016_0002$$$::I ask Tohsaka in a hushed voice.::
11265::$$$message_0089_0017_0000$$$::"If it's hard for you, I can carry you on my back if you want?"[lr]::
11266::$$$message_0089_0017_0001$$$::"...I can't trouble you that much.[lr]::
11267::$$$message_0089_0017_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服02a(中) textoff=0]Over here."::
11268::$$$message_0089_0018_0000$$$::We go to a corner of the rooftop that's hard to see from other students.[lr]::
11269::$$$message_0089_0018_0001$$$::For us to come over here must mean she has something to talk about that she can't have others hearing.::
11270::$$$message_0089_0019_0000$$$::"Tohsaka, did you catch a cold on the way back from England?"[lr]::
11271::$$$message_0089_0019_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
11272::$$$message_0089_0019_0002$$$::"There's times where you let your guard down since it's the way back and get sick the moment you arrive. That's why I thought it might be that."::
11273::$$$message_0089_0020_0000$$$::...There's no answer.[lr]::
11274::$$$message_0089_0020_0001$$$::We eat our bread sitting next to each other, but it's uncomfortable without any conversation. Oh yeah, I bought Tohsaka's drink too.::
11275::$$$message_0089_0021_0000$$$::"Here. It got cold so you'll probably only appreciate it less than half as much."[lr]::
11276::$$$message_0089_0021_0001$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服02a(近) textoff=0][say storage=sch0153_rin_0130 name=凛]Thanks."[lr]::
11277::$$$message_0089_0021_0002$$$::She thanks me modestly.[lr]::
11278::$$$message_0089_0021_0003$$$::Tohsaka has been feeling down this whole time, and it troubles me since my attempts end in failure as well.::
11279::$$$message_0089_0022_0000$$$::"...Ugh. Sorry for earlier, Emiya."[lr]::
11280::$$$message_0089_0022_0001$$$::"Huh? No, it's okay. As long as you're fine."[lr]::
11281::$$$message_0089_0022_0002$$$::I'm sure the opportunity to carry Tohsaka won't come along again anytime soon. That was a perk.::
11282::$$$message_0089_0023_0000$$$::"Just as you said, I might've let my guard down returning to Fuyuki. I thought I was fine in the morning, but I started feeling sick again."::
11283::$$$message_0089_0024_0000$$$::Tohsaka is touching her arm.[lr]::
11284::$$$message_0089_0024_0001$$$::...It would be hard to imagine collapsing because of arm pain, unless there's a fracture. [lr]::
11285::$$$message_0089_0024_0002$$$::But, I can understand why if I think about what Tohsaka has on her arm.::
11286::$$$message_0089_0025_0000$$$::"...Your Magic Crest?"[lr]::
11287::$$$message_0089_0025_0001$$$::It's definitely difficult to talk about in a big voice.[lr]::
11288::$$$message_0089_0025_0002$$$::Tohsaka also looks around before she nods.::
11289::$$$message_0089_0026_0000$$$::The Mystics of a mage that is passed down[line len=2]in other words, the Magic Crest, is a mage's inheritance engraved upon the body.[lr]::
11290::$$$message_0089_0026_0001$$$::I don't have one, but Tohsaka has one on her arm from her ancestors.::
11291::$$$message_0089_0027_0000$$$::"Long story short, it's like my ancestors of the Tohsaka family have been transplanted onto my arm."[lr]::
11292::$$$message_0089_0027_0001$$$::"...That's not very appealing."[lr]::
11293::$$$message_0089_0027_0002$$$::Tohsaka's analogy is creepy, but accurate.[lr]::
11294::$$$message_0089_0027_0003$$$::It's pretty much that, where mages engrave the resolve of their ancestors onto the body. That is no simple tool, but rather, it is more reminiscent of a curse or a grudge.::
11295::$$$message_0089_0028_0000$$$::"I've gotten used to many things since I was little, but when the cycles don't match up..."::
11296::$$$message_0089_0029_0000$$$::"I'm glad you were there at that time.[lr]::
11297::$$$message_0089_0029_0001$$$::Well, I didn't think I would be princess carried."[lr]::
11298::$$$message_0089_0029_0002$$$::"...There was no other way, I couldn't help it."::
11299::$$$message_0089_0030_0000$$$::"Oh, I'm not complaining. [cacheimage storage=凛制服05e(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服05e(近) textoff=0]I was just zoning out thinking that you're rather bold despite your appearance."[lr]::
11300::$$$message_0089_0030_0001$$$::I also laugh uncomfortably hearing Tohsaka's words.::
11301::$$$message_0089_0031_0000$$$::[clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=300]It was rather bold for an immediate action.[lr]::
11302::$$$message_0089_0031_0001$$$::I carried the number one model student of the school, Rin Tohsaka.[lr]::
11303::$$$message_0089_0031_0002$$$::I'm worried what others would say about Tohsaka more than me, but her attitude got a lot brighter as we talked.::
11304::$$$message_0089_0032_0000$$$::"...You seem to be a lot better; is it because you ate something?"[lr]::
11305::$$$message_0089_0032_0001$$$::"Ahaha, maybe...[cacheimage storage=凛制服04a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服04a(近) textoff=0]well no, my Crest will get suppressed if I rest a bit and focus. Although it seems like it'll take a bit of time before I get back to normal."::
11306::$$$message_0089_0033_0000$$$::Well that's good.[lr]::
11307::$$$message_0089_0033_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服01e(近) textoff=0]She has a lot more color in her face, and it seems like her appetite is coming back. Lunch break is almost over, and Tohsaka talks to me as she wraps her lunch box.::
11308::$$$message_0089_0034_0000$$$::"...I owe you another one now."[lr]::
11309::$$$message_0089_0034_0001$$$::"Why? I'm the one that keeps owing you. This finally balances it out."::
11310::$$$message_0089_0035_0000$$$::"...Just let me pay you back.[lr]::
11311::$$$message_0089_0035_0001$$$::It's no fun getting paid back for some time that I don't even remember."[lr]::
11312::$$$message_0089_0035_0002$$$::Tohsaka's opinion is so on-brand, it makes me want to smile.[lr]::
11313::$$$message_0089_0035_0003$$$::It seems like she's really back to her usual self.[lr]::
11314::$$$message_0089_0035_0004$$$::"All right, fine, how about we have a date sometime soon?"[lr]::
11315::$$$message_0089_0035_0005$$$::I feel at ease, so my tongue slips.[lr]::
11316::$$$message_0089_0035_0006$$$::"Sure, when?"[lr]::
11317::$$$message_0089_0035_0007$$$::"...What?"::
11318::$$$message_0089_0036_0000$$$::...I can't believe it.[lr]::
11319::$$$message_0089_0036_0001$$$::Tohsaka nods easily.[lr]::
11320::$$$message_0089_0036_0002$$$::Man, it's worth giving it a try and asking!::
11321::$$$message_0089_0037_0000$$$::"Going to hang out in Shinto sounds good. We can do a lot of shopping too."[lr]::
11322::$$$message_0089_0037_0001$$$::"Um, are you sure, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
11323::$$$message_0089_0037_0002$$$::"Huh? Well, you want to go, right?[lr]::
11324::$$$message_0089_0037_0003$$$::On a date with me."[lr]::
11325::$$$message_0089_0037_0004$$$::"Uh..."::
11326::$$$message_0089_0038_0000$$$::I can only say yes if she asks me that.[lr]::
11327::$$$message_0089_0038_0001$$$::Should I have asked her for something more?[lr]::
11328::$$$message_0089_0038_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服05b(近) textoff=0]But if I get ahead of myself and say something weird, I might ruin everything.::
11329::$$$message_0089_0039_0000$$$::"Okay, it's decided then. Let's hang out during the weekend."[lr]::
11330::$$$message_0089_0039_0001$$$::"Got it[line len=2][wvl canskip=0 time=1000]Oh, I don't have to tell Saber this, right?"[lr]::
11331::$$$message_0089_0039_0002$$$::"...I don't mind if you bring her."::
11332::$$$message_0089_0040_0000$$$::She laughs at me. I feel like she's saying, "Are you a chicken that can't even come to a date by yourself?" in a roundabout way.[lr]::
11333::$$$message_0089_0040_0001$$$::Of course that's not true, but I just asked out of courtesy if Tohsaka prefers Saber to come along.::
11334::$$$message_0089_0041_0000$$$::"...Of course I'd prefer one-on-one, fair and square."[lr]::
11335::$$$message_0089_0041_0001$$$::"I know, I'd prefer that too."[lr]::
11336::$$$message_0089_0041_0002$$$::I feel like this is more like a duel than a date... A date with Tohsaka is like a fight with real swords, [se storage=se020.wav]so I guess technically, I'm not wrong.::
11337::$$$message_0089_0042_0000$$$::"...Oh, the bell."[lr]::
11338::$$$message_0089_0042_0001$$$::"Yeah, we should get going... [cacheimage storage=凛制服08b(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服08b(近) textoff=0]I wonder what I'll be told if someone was watching earlier." [lr]::
11339::$$$message_0089_0042_0002$$$::"It can't be helped for you. But for me, I'll go through a harder time since I was the one carrying you."[lr]::
11340::$$$message_0089_0042_0003$$$::...Especially from Issei.[lr]::
11341::$$$message_0089_0042_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服03d(近) textoff=0]If I say it was an urgent rescue of one's life, he should understand.::
11342::$$$message_0089_0043_0000$$$::"Yeah... Well, I'll make that up to you with our date too.[lr]::
11343::$$$message_0089_0043_0001$$$::Look forward to it, Emiya."::
911240::$$$message_9089_0009_0002$$$::I can't leave her lying like this. I should hurry and carry her to the nurse's office.[r]::

